<title>SPAIN: Telefonica may make statement later.</title>
<headline>Telefonica may make statement later.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish telecoms group Telefonica de Espana said on Monday it could not make a comment immediately on a report it had set an alliance with U.S.'s MCI but said it may make a statement later this morning.</p>
<p>&quot;At the moment we have no comment. We'll talk again in half an hour,&quot; a Telefonica spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Earlier, Portugal Telecom said Telefonica Internacional, an international arm of Spain's Telefonica, had formed a Pan American joint venture with MCI.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
